  "description": "In the pitch-black night, lit only by pale moonlight, Soon-jeong surrenders herself to Master Jin-hu. Forced to take the place of her delicate mistress, the young maid becomes the secret outlet for a lord’s dark, unbridled lust. Jin-hu is cold, arrogant, and ruthless, treating Soon-jeong as a mere physical relief rather than a human being. He warns her never to expect affection or softness. Yet as his hard touch and relentless desires push her to her limits, Soon-jeong finds herself bound to a master whose cold breath and burning dynamic threaten to destroy her completely.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
